We also have some good news to share!
A new build is now live. Here is a list of fixes and improvements it introduced:
[list]
[*] Rebound default keyboard inputs: use Q to dodge, RMB to switch between active senses, and MMB to execute ranged attacks;
[*] Fixed an issue with key mapping;
[*] Improved player collision with certain enemies and environmental objects;
[*] Fixed Jikokuten's jump animations;
[*] Respawning will now fully restore the player's HP;
[*] Fixed the bullets GUI;
[*] Fixed an issue that caused the game to crash on startup;
[*] Improved GUI scaling according to the current screen resolution ratio.
[/list]

While PAX Online is coming to the end, the demo will be available until July 22. Hurry up and experience the fantastic world of Yami in the futuristic period of New Edo!
